ttps://valleylookout.com/2025/02/19/mccall-hospital-district-to-study-dissolution-puts-advisory-vote-on-hold/","line":128},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":130,"embedded":true},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":146,"embedded":true},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":156,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"McCall hospital district pauses funding on St. Luke’s housing amid legal questions","source":"https://valleylookout.com/2026/03/25/mccall-hospital-district-hits-pause-on-st-lukes-housing-amid-legal-questions/","author":["[[Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor]]"],"published":"2026-03-25","created":"2026-07-07","description":"Additional taxpayer subsidies for a St. Luke’s McCall employee housing project are on hold while the state’s top legal official determines if the subsidies are constitutional.   That revelation came last week as the McCall Memorial Hospital District Board of Trustees discussed how it might spend about $1.6 million in property taxes collected this year from property owners […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},